SUMMARY:COFFEE AFTER DARK | SHADES OF BEIGE ROOFTOP PARTY
DESCRIPTION:Coffee After Dark returns to the MC Hotel Rooftop for another night of incredible people\, rooftop views\, handcrafted coffee\, cocktails\, and the soundtrack we’ve become known for. \nThe sounds of Afro House. Latin House. Amapiano. Afrobeats & more will be curated by CULTR to keep you moving and dancing all night long. \nAnd this time\, we’re setting the tone in BEIGE. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/coffee-after-dark-shades-of-beige-rooftop-party/
LOCATION:The Splendid Rooftop\, 690 Bloomfield Ave\, Montclair\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art & Culture,Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-08-14-124309.png
ORGANIZER;CN="The MC Hotel":MAILTO:sales@themchotel.com
