DESCRIPTION:<span>On Friday\, September 11\, 2026 at noon (12pm) we will c
 ommemorate the 25th Anniversary of the tragic day in American History know
 n as September 11\, 2001 with a <b>Eucharist in our Chapel</b>. The servic
 e will be <b>in-person and available via Zoom </b>using Sunday Services Lo
 gin Credentials. Our prayers will be for all affected by the events of tha
 t day. Join us as we pray and remember. <b><u>#neverforget</u></b></span>
