SUMMARY:Movie: Saturday Night
DESCRIPTION:At 11:30pm on October 11th\, 1975\, a ferocious troupe of young 
 comedians and writers changed television forever. Find out what happened 
 behind the scenes in the 90 minutes leading up to the first broadcast of 
