SUMMARY:Local Author Visit in Honor of Hispanic Heritage Month
DESCRIPTION:Join us in the Children's Area of the Main Library where 
 Melinda González will present her debut kids' book\, Curious Mind and 
 Dancing Feet. Copies of the book will be available for purchase.  All 
 children and their grownups are welcome!\n\nNote from the author: “The 
 book follows a Puerto Rican Muslim girl as she shares what it's like to 
 live with ADHD\, from a wandering mind and the wiggles to the laser focus 
 she brings to her love of bugs. With the support of her Mami\, Abuelita\, 
 and friends\, the story celebrates disability joy and the strengths\, 
 complexity\, and wonder of a neurodiverse mind.”
LOCATION:Bloomfield Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Bloomfield Library":MAILTO:reference@bloomfield.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Story Time
UID:LibCal-10270-17532673
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17532673
