SUMMARY:RSC: Insight into Rehearsal
DESCRIPTION:What is it like to step into the rehearsal room of a Royal Shakespeare Company production? This lecture and demonstration offers a look into the process behind one of the world’s foremost Shakespearian interpreters. All are welcome for this chance to see three amazing artists demonstrate the methodology of how RSC artists approach the exploration\, analysis\, and staging of a scene. The featured artists are Aaron Parsons\, Joseph Arkley\, and Eloise Secker.
