UID:5999-1789673400-1789678800@www.peakperfs.org
SUMMARY:A.I.M by Kyle Abraham: White Space
DESCRIPTION:Run Time: 1 hour \nWhite Space brings together acclaimed composers\, Jason Moran and Nico Muhly\, for a haunting new collaborative score that pierces the heart of choreographer Kyle Abraham’s newest evening-length dance. At just over one hour\, this dance work grounds its cast of 11 captivating dancers in a restless and thought-provoking world fueled by a vast movement vocabulary consisting of Abraham’s signature blend of classical and contemporary dance with a hip-hop underbelly. The score is performed live by two pianists on one piano\, with echoes of pre-recorded hip-hop driving the collision of reality and idealism. \n“lush movement\, infectious music and magnetic dancers…” (The New York Times) \n \nAbout A.I.M by Kyle Abraham: Celebrating its 20th anniversary throughout 2026\, A.I.M by Kyle Abraham has been at the forefront of contemporary dance for nearly two decades and has become one of the most acclaimed touring companies in the world. A.I.M has been featured in Vogue\, Essence\, among many other publications\, and was on the April 2025 cover of Harper’s Bazaar. The company is described as a “postmodern gumbo” with an ardent voice and artistic process informed by robust conversations with people from diverse perspectives. A.I.M performs works by Abraham as well as new and existing works by choreographers who have influenced Abraham’s artistry. \nFounded in 2006 and based in New York City\, A.I.M has spent two decades at the forefront of the field. It has earned recognition for its “lush movement\, infectious music and magnetic dancers…” (The New York Times)\, becoming one of the most acclaimed touring ensembles in the world. Grounded in a commitment to reshaping how artists are supported\, the company provides dancers with 52-week salaries and retirement benefits\, alongside royalty payments in perpetuity for their role in the creation of new work. A.I.M continues to expand what a contemporary dance company can be and who gets to imagine themselves within it. In doing so\, the organization challenges the entire arts ecosystem to create space where more people can thrive. \nFor more information\, to get involved\, or to purchase your A.I.M merchandise\, please visit http://aimbykyleabraham.org. \nFollow A.I.M on Instagram @aimbykyleabraham and\nKyle Abraham on Instagram  @kyle_abraham_original_recipe
URL:https://www.peakperfs.org/event/a-i-m-by-kyle-abraham-white-space/
CATEGORIES:2026 - 2027
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.peakperfs.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LOGOS-1080x1350-FINAL-8.03-WS_03.jpg
END:VEVENT
