 span>activities for kids</span></b></strong>\, <strong><b><span>a DJ</span
 ></b></strong></span><span>\, <strong><b><span>food vendors</span></b></s
 trong> and a<strong><b><span> Pet Parade at 2:30pm</span></b></strong> 
