SUMMARY:Community Listening Session with Garden State Equality
DESCRIPTION:Join Garden State Equality for a community listening session 
 focused on LGBTQ  equality in New Jersey. Learn about upcoming 
 legislation\, share experiences with existing community resources\, and 
 discuss current needs and priorities. The session will help inform Garden 
 State Equality’s work to better tailor resources and support 
 community-led networks across New Jersey.
