DTEND:20261008T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
SUMMARY:Chess and Coffee
DESCRIPTION:Come play chess with a nice cup of coffee at our weekly meetup! 
 Chess boards will be provided\, but feel free to bring your own.\n\nThis is 
 a drop-in open play\, there will be no guided instruction. Registration is 
 recommended for updates.\n
