SUMMARY:Halloween Monster Mash - Ages 2-6
DESCRIPTION:Register children only.\n\nJoin us for this fun and energetic 
 program. We will sing\, dance\, play instruments\, have bubbles and use the 
 parachute!\n\nAdd to the excitement and come in your Halloween 
 costume!\n\nChildren under the age of 8 must be accompanied by an adult at 
 all times.\n\nGlen Ridge residents.
