 _Og4Bj9JlGOIhu  \n  \n**Shabbat Sha-Blue-Jeans**  \nJoin Rabbi Uri for a s
 pirited and fun Shabbat service.  \nWear your jeans and come ready to sing
  and dance as we welcome Shabbat together!  \nOpen to all families with ki
 ds in second grade and younger.  \n(Older siblings are welcome.)  \n  \n**
 Shabbat Dinner**   \nFamilies are invited to join for dinner\, stay after 
 Shabbat Sha-Blue-Jeans or come for dinner before the JLC Family Service.  
