DESCRIPTION:Deck the Halls is an annual celebration of our community\, thi
 s year honoring The Montclair Foundation Trustee\, Betty Jagoda Murphy\, a
 nd the amazingHuman Needs Pantry of Montclair.Details about our annual fun
 draiser celebration coming soon! Sponsors and volunteers can contact Info@
 vanvleck.org to learn how to get involved.
LOCATION:Montclair Art Museum\, 3 South Mountain Avenue\, Montclair\, NJ
URL:https://montclairfoundation.org/event/deck-the-halls-2026/
X-SOURCE:Montclair Foundation
END:VEVENT
