DESCRIPTION:<span>On<span> </span></span><b><b>Sunday\, November 22\, 202
 6</b></b><span> all parishioners are asked to return their<span> </span><
 /span><a href="https://www.holyspiritverona.org/uploads/1/4/2/4/142411498/
 stewardshipforms2024_final.pdf" target="_blank"><b><b><b>Re-C</b></b></b><
 b><b><b>ommitment Forms</b></b></b></a><span>. We ask you to reflect on t
 he gifts you have received in abundance\, and to consider how God is calli
 ng you to share your<span> </span></span><b><b>time\, talent and treasure
  in this community</b></b><span>. Join together as we explore the ways in 
 which we discern how we </span><b><b>walk in God's love</b></b><span>\, an
 d how we might share that love with and beyond the Holy Spirit Verona Chur
 ch Family. </span>
