SUMMARY:Brick Builders Club (Grades K-5)
DESCRIPTION:Thursdays at 3:45 PM \n\nSeptember 17\, October 15\, November 
 12 and December 17\n\nMeet up with LEGO fans and work on a building 
 challenge! \n\nFor students entering grades K-5 in Fall 2026. 
 \n\nRegistration is required and limited to Nutley Public Library 
 cardholders. \n\nFor more information\, visit nutleypubliclibrary.org or 
 call 973-667-0405 ext. 2623.
